<title>DUBAI: Sharjah air cargo volumes climb 40 pct in March.</title>
<headline>Sharjah air cargo volumes climb 40 pct in March.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sharjah airport said cargo volumes rose almost 40 percent in March to 36,174 tonnes from 25,893 tonnes in the same month last year.</p>
<p>Sea-air freight exports rose 16 percent to 3,091 tonnes from 2,661 in March 1996.</p>
<p>Last year the airport handled a total 320,607 tonnes of cargo, a 19 percent rise on the previous year.</p>
<p>-- Dubai newsroom +9714-626990</p>
